SUMMARY:Legacy & Connection: 25+ Year Alumni Brunch Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Knox College is delighted to host an upcoming special anniversary event: Legacy & Connection: 25+ Year Alumni Brunch Celebration. \nJoin us for a relaxed morning with delicious food\, engaging conversations\, and a chance to reconnect with your fellow alumni. Whether you’ve stayed in touch or haven’t seen some faces in years\, this event is sure to be a memorable occasion. Come share your memories with us! \nAt this event\, Knox College will be honouring those alumni reaching significant milestones of 25\, 30\, 40\, 50\, and 60+ years of achievement. Don’t miss this opportunity to be part of a memorable gathering where history and tradition come together. We can’t wait to celebrate you! \nAlumni Reunion Brunch will be held: \n\nDate: Tuesday May 12th\, 2026\nTime: 10:30am\nLocation: Knox College\, Classroom 4\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nREGISTER HERE\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease RSVP by May 1st to help us with planning. \nIf you have any questions or need further details\, feel free to reach out to us by emailing knox.advancement@utoronto.ca. We look forward to seeing you!
URL:https://knox.utoronto.ca/event/legacy-connection-25-year-alumni-brunch-celebration/
LOCATION:Knox College Room 4
END:VEVENT
