SUMMARY:New Grad & Alumni Lunch
DESCRIPTION:Before Knox College’s 182nd Convocation Ceremony\, join us for a New Graduate & Alumni Lunch in the Rotunda from 12:00–1:30 PM. This is a wonderful opportunity to reconnect with fellow alumni\, welcome our newest graduates\, and celebrate their achievements together.
URL:https://knox.utoronto.ca/event/new-grad-alumni-lunch/
LOCATION:Knox College Rotunda
END:VEVENT
