SUMMARY:Legacy in Motion: Living Generously with a Future in Mind - Lorne Jackson and Mary Lynn Huizing
DESCRIPTION:Legacy isn’t a distant idea—it’s something you’re shaping with every decision\, every act of generosity\, and every conversation. Join us for Legacy in Motion\, a free webinar hosted by Lorne Jackson and Mary Lynn Huizing and our partners at Advisors with Purpose\, created to help you consider how your values and generosity today can create meaningful impact for years to come. In this session\, we’ll explore: \n\nThe deeper “why” behind living generously\nHow to structure giving—now and through your estate\nWays to share your plans and purpose with your family\nHow to inspire others through your example\nTools that help align your faith\, values\, and finances\n\n      Link to register: https://calendly.com/awpwebinar/may-27-2026
URL:https://knox.utoronto.ca/event/legacy-in-motion-living-generously-with-a-future-in-mind-lorne-jackson-and-mary-lynn-huizing/
END:VEVENT
